--- !u!1001 &2317221302747234686
PrefabInstance:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  serializedVersion: 2
  m_Modification:
    serializedVersion: 3
    m_TransformParent: {fileID: 1424640380}
    m_Modifications:
    - target: {fileID: 211335780372273309, guid: 7f9bb14e56d475d4aa6b54df54d11d3e,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'descriptions.Array.data[1]'
      value: Find and secure your <nobr>go-bag</nobr>! Both your starting position
        and the <color=#FF8B43>bag spawn randomly each round</color>, so explore
        the rooms quickly to locate it before packing your emergency supplies.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 211335780372273309, guid: 7f9bb14e56d475d4aa6b54df54d11d3e,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'descriptions.Array.data[2]'
      value: <color=#FF8B43>Items</color> are placed in realistic locations. For
        example, water is often in the kitchen. Hold an item to see its name and
        description.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 211335780372273309, guid: 7f9bb14e56d475d4aa6b54df54d11d3e,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'descriptions.Array.data[6]'
      value: "Catalogs every item you can find and tracks which ones you\u2019ve
        unlocked. <color=#FF4343>Items start locked</color> in the Journal and <color=#96B000>unlock</color>
        once you pack them and finish a drill."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 211335780372273309, guid: 7f9bb14e56d475d4aa6b54df54d11d3e,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'descriptions.Array.data[8]'
      value: "After you finish packing, you\u2019ll answer scenario-based questions.
        <color=#FF8B43>Drag the correct item</color> into the answer box. This helps
        you remember why each item matters."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1611133491166292635, guid: 7f9bb14e56d475d4aa6b54df54d11d3e,
